{"term":"look down on","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:ca5b661509e703b4cb","definition":"To regard or treat as inferior.","example":"He remembers feeling that people looked down on him, and, ‘realising I was rubbish at academic stuff’, he decided he'd join a circus.","pos":"verb","synonyms":["disesteem","disdain","look down one's nose","contemn","despect","disrespect","despise","disdain","disesteem","look down on","misrespect","scorn","spurn"],"antonyms":["look up to","respect","esteem","honor","idolize","lay store by","look up to","prize","hallow","put store by","put store in","rate","regard","respect","revere","set store by","value","venerate","worthy"],"collocations":[],"usage":"idiomatic","register":"idiomatic, transitive","wordFamily":["look upon"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/look_down_on#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:6a77ad7d99ce6bccd1","definition":"To view from a vantage point.","example":"High up on the viaduct, and approached by a spidery staircase from the street, it looks down on Southwark Cathedral.","pos":"verb","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"transitive","wordFamily":["look upon"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/look_down_on#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:c7d3dd1fdbbca9a9a9","definition":"To view [people or events on Earth] from the vantage point of the afterlife (originally, Heaven).","example":"I get a feeling Kurt Cobain is looking down on Nickelback and wondering what alternative rock has become.","pos":"verb","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"idiomatic","register":"idiomatic, transitive","wordFamily":["look upon"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/look_down_on#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"pronunciation":{"us":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f6/En-au-look_down_on.ogg/En-au-look_down_on.ogg.mp3"},"wordFamily":["look upon"]}